{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16627","headline":"杂感 · 鲍防","name":"杂感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家海内承平久，万国戎王皆稽首。\n天马常衔苜蓿花，胡人岁献葡萄酒。\n五月荔枝初破颜，朝离象郡夕函关。\n鴈飞不到桂阳岭，马走先过林邑山。\n甘泉御果垂仙阁，日暮无人香自落。\n远物皆重近皆轻，鸡虽有德不如鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}